<title>USA: Ancor Communications expands in Europe.</title>
<headline>Ancor Communications expands in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ancor Communications Inc said Monday it signed a distribution agreement with ADIVA Computertechnologie GmbH to sell its products in Germany, Austria and Switzerland.</p>
<p>The company said the contract calls for ADIVA to buy $2.5 million worth of Ancor products in 1997. ADIVA is a distributor of high-performance computers and network products in Western and Central Europe, Ancor said.</p>
<p>Ancor provides computer network support products, such as switches, routers, adapters and custom integrated circuits.</p>
<p>It shares closed up 7/8 Monday at 13-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
